{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1d3bee6110f73569bf5899b907aa687ddf86fca5b844fdbac695143e67a24f37","ja":"街ロケで能力駆使！？","zh":"街头外景全力施展！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f937e61d521f6c820445b4a64f3572910f01e0ecebf62544b920d2e4cab868d2","ja":"今日の亜美と杏奈のお仕事は、街ブラロケ！\nドラマの番宣も兼ねているけれど……","zh":"今天亚美和杏奈的工作是街头漫步外景拍摄！\n虽然同时也兼具电视剧的宣传，但是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c84d95a9a06d3776c962bc454e413ae2c504b3d51195113088e5adfc2fffe5bc","ja":"「では、歩行者の方にインタビューしてください。\nよろしくお願いします！」","zh":"“那么，请去采访一下路人吧。\n拜托您了！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8719346ce55cf591668c2225034dc93e752429af1ce0554a271c8e939f369b56","ja":"よろしくお願いしま～す♪\nそれじゃあさっそく……あれっ？","zh":"请多关照～♪\n那么马上就……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e87d88885d7550b4069504b902a1e997277edfe8302d600d0904d00b1e391d8a","ja":"（亜美ちゃんからメッセージが届いてる……。\n一緒にいるのに、どうしたんだろ？）","zh":"（收到亚美发来的消息了……\n明明就在一起，怎么了吗？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f271b6afb426769c2780743abd1da6569e60f76a4a4ae67a95a3fc5ddcf11ff3","ja":"んっふっふ～。気づいたようだね、もっちー。\nそれは亜美専用『ともだちコントローラー』だよ～ん♪","zh":"哼～哼哼～。看来你注意到了呢，望望。\n那就是亚美专用的“朋友手柄”哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"75e74409b056ddd57b2e10a2913b3fa5770b6fcbf564afa64d618488f5d14a9f","ja":"君にはこれから、インタビューをしながら、同時に\n亜美が送る指示をこなしてもらう！","zh":"你接下来要一边接受采访，一边\n完成亚美发出的指示！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ec2c426271c4960e4b5f75dda04a8b3ee323718c2e662d4ecdf60abc5359822f","ja":"ええっ！？　どうして突然！？","zh":"诶！？怎么这么突然！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0c48b69faab03f5fd6b3c46785c1783ca0f1cabcae48760c3fea902ab4dd8882","ja":"ただお話しするだけじゃ、面白くないっしょ。\nそれに、せっかくならドラマに関係あることしたいし。","zh":"光是聊聊天的话，多没意思呀。\n而且，难得有机会，我想做些和电视剧相关的事情。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"66e42742e2797f0db109c00409ed42e01fbe8c0eab74817a33bb080014941a71","ja":"だから、ドラマで杏奈が使ってた能力で、\n杏奈に指示を出すってこと？","zh":"也就是说，要用杏奈在剧里用过的超能力，\n来向杏奈下达指示？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"520a253e96f6a634e702447a6eb21f2454f5171d5b16e107e55fe1da877624bf","ja":"そういうこと！　逆のパターンも新鮮っしょ？\nというわけで、よろしくね、もっちー☆","zh":"就是这样！反过来的模式也挺新鲜的吧？\n所以说，请多指教啦，小桃子☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9186abe8ec6cbd3c0484364d825d6e38e62b835bfe5b9feaa3756a78d71fda41","ja":"うーん……亜美ちゃんと遊ぶのはいいけど、\nスタッフさんや番組に、迷惑がかかるかもだし……。","zh":"嗯……和亚美玩倒是不打紧，\n不过可能会给工作人员和节目添麻烦……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1cb6ea36fa4b06cc55094e110498e9973bc27a35636a5b13b38b2abaf1ae991b","ja":"めちゃくちゃな指示はしないから、安心してちょ！\n亜美は、ハイリョバッチリンコのデキる女だからね！","zh":"我不会乱下离谱指示的，放宽心啦！\n亚美可是超级体贴又精明能干的女人嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9bd76bd90df660c61f291667c3c2d99f204f0c19587e16b55e8130ed6a427584","ja":"うーん……それだったらいいかな？\nちょっと、面白そうだし！","zh":"嗯……那样的话也可以吧？\n而且感觉挺有意思的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6b1b2d32b5ffbd146c1fa7269ee9b0acb36a649e654970a27d271d6d3ddbeab5","ja":"それじゃあ、最初の指示は……。","zh":"那么，最初的指示是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f6efd2b3178a486bc443babceb5a53a7282df20657c8b6105dfd3b455aebcf6d","ja":"『インタビューの中にダジャレを入れ込むこと！\n目指せ、お茶の間の笑いを独り占め☆』","zh":"“在采访中穿插冷笑话！\n目标是，独揽千家万户的笑声☆”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1636.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3d8dc6b8d67d6bcb758ea3f7504887d2cbd6236c0c2e97ad55329e241e9deaf4","ja":"……やっぱり、OK出さなきゃよかったかも……。","zh":"……果然，当时或许不该答应的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
